{"id":"int-31a98878cd48e8f835b5cf9ecf01cac4","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-07-30T17:07:43.45171265Z","actor":"Sergei Wallace","issue_id":"AI-CLI-n20","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Root cause: all 7 skips were one defect — google-genai guarded by importorskip but never a declared dep in any group, so CI (uv sync --dev) and every dev machine skipped unconditionally. Verdict: masking a coverage gap, not env-conditional. Fix: google-genai>=1.0 added to [dependency-groups] dev (test-only; runtime import stays lazy/optional), all 7 importorskip guards removed. Suite: 2002 passed / 0 skipped; ruff clean. BUG-007 doc: docs/bugs/genai-tests-skipped-everywhere.md"}}
{"id":"int-81ed72fc6ffad225ff3aa75f1330173e","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-07-30T22:21:18.578440644Z","actor":"Sergei Wallace","issue_id":"AI-CLI-v1t","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"open","reason":"Root cause: uv cache dir and tool-install dir on different filesystems (different st_dev) -> hardlink impossible -> uv falls back to copy and warns. Fix: resolve uv's own cache/install dirs, compare st_dev, pass --link-mode=copy only when they differ; never hardcoded (preserves hardlink fast path on single-fs machines); any resolution/stat failure falls through to prior behavior. Wired into all 4 call sites (update, background auto-update, ai upgrade, extra_venvs pip install). Verified LIVE with negative control: warning present without flag, absent with it; real 'ai update' now clean. Installed build verified by content (5 occurrences). Suite 2009 passed / 0 skipped; ruff clean. Commit aa8a247. Doc: docs/bugs/uv-hardlink-fallback-warning.md (BUG-008)."}}
